flowchart TB
    D["DECISION"]

    D --> DECIDERS["DECIDERS<br/>Authority to make or veto"]
    D --> DOERS["DOERS<br/>Will execute"]
    D --> AFFECTED["AFFECTED<br/>Work or position changes"]
    D --> INFORMED["INFORMED<br/>Need to know but do not decide"]

    DECIDERS -->|"1. informally first"| MSG1["What they need:<br/>The decision (clear),<br/>rationale (sharp),<br/>alternatives considered,<br/>what changes for them"]

    DOERS -->|"2. their input shapes plan"| MSG2["What they need:<br/>What they will do,<br/>what is NOT changing,<br/>when more detail comes"]

    AFFECTED -->|"3. before they hear from anyone else"| MSG3["What they need:<br/>What changes for them,<br/>when, what is NOT changing,<br/>who they go to with concerns"]

    INFORMED -->|"4. at appropriate moments"| MSG4["What they need:<br/>What changed, why,<br/>what (if anything) is asked"]

    MSG1 --> ONE_ON_ONE["1:1 calibration<br/>(required for any decision<br/>affecting >10 people)"]
    MSG2 --> ONE_ON_ONE
    MSG3 --> ONE_ON_ONE
    MSG4 --> ONE_ON_ONE

    ONE_ON_ONE --> CADENCE["Follow-up cadence:<br/>T=0+2-3d, +1wk, +2wk, +4wk, +8wk"]

    style D fill:#9bc7d8,stroke:#2c5f7f,stroke-width:3px
    style DECIDERS fill:#e8f4f8,stroke:#2c5f7f
    style DOERS fill:#e8f4f8,stroke:#2c5f7f
    style AFFECTED fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#b8860b,stroke-width:2px
    style INFORMED fill:#e8f4f8,stroke:#2c5f7f
    style ONE_ON_ONE fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#b8860b,stroke-width:2px
